    "updated_at": "2021-08-12T17:25:29Z",
    "body": "> † It’s probably possible to deliver the favicon.ico as image/svg+xml, however this approach seems hacky and not like one we would want to promote as a best practice.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure I agree? It's worth testing, but I think if we can keep the number of HTTP requests to 1, the fact that the request happens to have `.ico` in the URL shouldn't stop us from reusing it.",
